{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is close, take it and process it. If not, approach it, take it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObjectTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <Condition ID = IsRobotApproachingObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    />\"",
